# Runtime assets synced from S3 and bind-mounted at runtime (see docker-compose
# override on the server). Keeping the 5 GB of GIS layers and the YOLO weights
# out of the build context makes a rebuild a code-only operation. The
# git-tracked gradient_profiles/ subtree stays in the image.
backend/shapefiles/*
!backend/shapefiles/gradient_profiles
backend/models/
